# cc_config is a separate Bazel module root, so building it in place (as the
# validation flow does via --override_module) drops its own output symlinks
# here. The workspace-root .gitignore's /bazel-* is anchored and does not reach
# this subdirectory. MODULE.bazel.lock is intentionally NOT ignored — this repo
# commits lockfiles (see the tracked root MODULE.bazel.lock).
/bazel-*
